{%- comment -%}
  ═══ LBASS — ARABIC LABEL FOR AN ACTIVE COLOUR TAG (2026-08-29) ═══

  WHY IT EXISTS
  The colour tag URLs are indexable, self-canonical and stocked, but they were
  titled with the ENGLISH tag word while every ranking query is Arabic. Measured
  on the live storefront 2026-08-29:

      /collections/track-pants/black   <title>… — black    9 products
      /collections/track-pants/red     <title>… — red      5 products
      /collections/track-pants/grey    <title>… — grey     5 products

  The 90-day Search Console pull recorded in snippets/lbass-colour-nav.liquid
  shows what those pages are actually being served for:

      بنطال تراك أسود   79 impr  pos 15.8
      بنطال تراك أحمر   64 impr  pos 13.1   0 clicks
      بنطال تراك رمادي  12 impr  pos 37.0

  64 impressions at position 13.1 with ZERO clicks is a title problem, not a
  ranking problem — the word the shopper typed (أحمر) appeared nowhere in the
  snippet they were shown. This snippet puts it there.

  WHY THE MSA FORM AND NOT THE CHIP LABEL
  The visible chips read كحل / حمر — correct Darija, and they stay that way.
  Search Console records the queries in MSA (أسود / أحمر / رمادي). Titles and H1s
  follow the query; the on-page chips follow the shopper. Do not "harmonise"
  these two — they are answering different questions.

  GENDER TAGS (added 2026-09-04)
  The النوع filter puts `gender:men` / `gender:women` / `gender:unisex` in the
  path, and those are INTERNAL tags — unmapped they leaked verbatim into the
  <title> ("Lbass Original — gender:men"), which is both an English label in
  front of an Arabic-speaking shopper and a bad SERP snippet. They now map to
  رجال / نساء / للجنسين. Any new namespaced tag must be added here too.

  FALLBACK
  An unmapped tag echoes unchanged, so a new tag can never blank a <title>.

  USAGE
    {%- capture t_ar -%}{%- render 'lbass-tag-ar', tags: current_tags -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign lb_tag_raw = ''
  if tags != blank
    assign lb_tag_raw = tags | first | downcase | strip
  endif

  assign lb_map_keys = 'black,red,grey,gray,navy,blue,green,white,beige,brown,burgundy,purple,sage,silver,multicolor,neon-green,khaki,pink,orange,yellow,gender:men,gender:women,gender:unisex' | split: ','
  assign lb_map_vals = 'أسود,أحمر,رمادي,رمادي,كحلي,أزرق,أخضر,أبيض,بيج,بني,عنابي,بنفسجي,زيتي,فضي,متعدد الألوان,أخضر نيون,كاكي,وردي,برتقالي,أصفر,رجال,نساء,للجنسين' | split: ','

  assign lb_out = lb_tag_raw
  for k in lb_map_keys
    if k == lb_tag_raw
      assign lb_out = lb_map_vals[forloop.index0]
      break
    endif
  endfor

  echo lb_out
-%}
